1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,000
ProphetGrid: conditional macro and tech markets,
adjudicated by validators instead of an admin key.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:08,400
Every market carries a primary source,
literal criteria and a funded custody vault.

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:12,000
The consensus inspector exposes the comparative
principle and the five anchor confidence ladder.

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:16,400
The What-If simulator shows implied odds, payout,
ROI and exact dust conservation.

5
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:21,600
The guard lab mirrors each revert rule,
then sends a real transaction.

6
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:25,500
A premature claim is refused on chain
while the challenge window is open.

7
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:31,500
Mint test collateral on a burner wallet
and switch identity in one click.

8
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:36,400
Every trade moves collateral into the vault,
never into an operator wallet.

9
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:42,400
Buy YES shares on an open market.
The trade settles through the same vault.

10
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:47,200
Four way sha256 identity binds the source,
the git blob, GitHub and the chain.
